      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "More money to spend, more USB ports to use up... but would be nice to be able to better track my elbows.\n\nIf anything needs better algorithms for how joints bend and twist during full body tracking with 6 point.\n\nHead is not really tracked well, and my avatar's head often will be too low or too high.  I have to pull my tracker down, press the sync triggers, then pull it back up, it has to sit high on my waist, just so my head actually lines up.\n\nMy elbows also seem to fold in on them selves when I raise my hands over my head. looks weird.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
